See printed p. 110, partial summation (1.8)--(1.9) on p. 13, and Theorem 10.6
on pp. 106--107, whose project implementation is reviewed in `SEM-438`. -/
theorem LFunction_eq_abelIntegral_of_isPrimitive
    {q : ℕ} [NeZero q] (hq : 1 < q)
