        ∑' i : ℕ, |maynardS2ReciprocalGCorrectionAF W (p ^ i)|) ≤
        ∏ p ∈ N.primesBelow, (1 + 5 * primeTotientSquareWeight p) := by
      apply Finset.prod_le_prod
      · intro p hp
